  "body": "This came out of #2681.\r\n\r\nI modified the text for creating a new browsing context to mention the copying of SessionStorage.\r\n\r\nThis patch also adds the behavior discussed in #2681 where browsing contexts created with `noopener` do not get `sessionStorage` copied. In order to do that, I had to propagate information about whether the `noopener` attribute is present to the browsing context creation logic, which is where most of the changes occur.",
